Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T19:21:05-07:00","id":1098985,"title":"","content":"I would love to hear more about<b></b>:<br /> 1) the relationship between Beasts and other splats<br /> 2) Beast cooperation in the face of Heroes, Hunters &amp; Insatiables<br /> 3) I'd love to hear about the sane Heroes hinted at in Beast the Primordial pp. 202, and maybe hear about these rare individuals teaming up with or even joining Broods to fulfill the original Hero purpose or even team with Beasts to fight Insatiables","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-01T03:58:29-07:00","id":1099097,"title":"","content":"Yesss....<ul><li>The Hero's place in the ecology of dreaming.</li> <li>How to run kinships if you don't have the splatbooks.</li> <li>How Beast societies interact outside of individual broods.</li> <li>Uses for the Dark Mother.</li> <li>A bit more on Insatiables.</li> <li>Setting hacks...</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-01T04:15:41-07:00","id":1099106,"title":"","content":"It'd be neat to see ideas for things which can disturb the primordial dream other than Horrors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-01T08:56:21-07:00","id":1099169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1079624-beast-storyteller-s-guide?p=1099106#post1099106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It'd be neat to see ideas for things which can disturb the primordial dream other than Horrors.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe things like the effects of mass hysteria or mass trauma on the Dream. Or maybe something along the lines of &quot;Dreamquakes&quot; that ripple through the reality of the Dream at various times","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83